  "text": "Weekend rentals fell from 256 in August to 171 in September, a 49.7% drop. Part of that is the calendar: September had 8 weekend days against 10 in August, so rentals per weekend day went from 25.6 to 21.4. Riverside accounts for most of the rest: its weekend rentals went from 75 to 14 while its 3 stations were closed for roadworks. Outside Riverside, weekend rentals per day changed by +2.2%, within normal day-to-day variation (p = 0.87). We recommend a temporary dock at the Riverside footbridge until the roadworks end, and a 15% weekend discount sent to the 52 casual riders who stopped riding."
